NAME
    gcloud beta observability buckets datasets - manage Dataset resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta observability buckets datasets GROUP | COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) Manage Dataset resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

GROUPS
    GROUP is one of the following:

     links
        (BETA) Manage Link resources.

     views
        (BETA) Manage View resources.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (BETA) Describe datasets.

     list
        (BETA) List datasets.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice.

